  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7e787bb2f794a6a4695134e4583867ae, type: 3}
  m_Name: Third Eye obstacle
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Character
  charName: Eternity
  characterSprite: {fileID: 2816740430268824205, guid: db9b608722c4b6c41b021dd058fcbd3a, type: 3}
  lines:
  - Wait...
  - Do you see that?
  - The vines have spread into Pure Purgatory. Using Third Eye here will create an
    obstacle rather than remove one.
  - This soul must have suffered far more than I anticipated.
  - You'll need to be careful of how you use Third Eye from now on. Some obstacles
    only exist in one state of Purgatory, while others reveal themselves when the
    ability is active.
  - Pay close attention to your surroundings. The path forward may change depending
    on which state you're in.
  - '...I wonder what else has crossed over. '
  - Stay alert.
